<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets 200 million stg five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets 200 million stg five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Bankers Trust and ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANKERS TRUST INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    07.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +6.25 BP  PAY DATE    07.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.84     FULL FEES   0.15</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY   U.S.</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
